# Float multiplication of exactly representable values

Multiplies 2.25 by 1.5 to verify native single-precision multiplication
for values exactly representable in f32, producing 3.375.

>>> source
float_left: float = 1.5
float_right: float = 2.25

float_product: float = float_right * float_left
print(float_product)

<<< stdout
3.375

<<< stderr
